                <head>American claims against Germany in the case of the sinking of the American
                    ship <hi rendition="#italic">Robin Moor</hi> by a German submarine</head>
                <p>[For President Roosevelt’s address to Congress on June 20, 1941, and
                    correspondence between the Department of State and the German Embassy regarding
                    the sinking of the <hi rendition="#italic">Robin Moor</hi>, see Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, June 21, 1941, page 741, and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, November 8, 1941, page 363.]</p>
            </div>
